 "5. Disclaimer of Warranties (\"As-Is\")": "5. Penafian Jaminan (\"Apa Adanya\")",
 "6. Cleanly for SVGs: Stripping Editor Metadata, Not EXIF": "6. Cleanly untuk SVG: Menghapus Metadata Editor, Bukan EXIF",
